            "review_title": "Review at Woomaster - Korean Aging Steak House - Trung Hoà",
            "review_text": "Mr Tiến Lalago\nHanoi, Vietnam40 contributions\n0\nAn Intimate and Enjoyable Dinner for Two\nNov 2025 • Couples\nAn intimate and satisfying dining experience for two\n\nMy wife and I chose Woo Master Trung Hoa for a special dinner together, and it turned out to be a truly enjoyable experience. The restaurant offers a warm, stylish atmosphere that feels both comfortable and refined ideal for a quiet meal as a couple.\n\nThe space is well designed, with enough privacy to allow relaxed conversation while still maintaining a lively yet elegant dining vibe. It felt like a place where you can slow down, enjoy good food, and fully appreciate the moment together.\n\nThe food was excellent. Dishes were well prepared, flavorful, and beautifully presented. The quality of ingredients stood out, and each course felt thoughtfully crafted rather than rushed. Everything was satisfying without being overwhelming, making the meal feel well balanced.\n\nService was attentive and professional. The staff was courteous, helpful with recommendations, and well paced, allowing us to enjoy our dinner without interruptions. This level of service really enhanced the overall experience.\n\nOverall, Woo Master Trung Hoa is a great choice for couples looking for a pleasant, high-quality dining experience whether for a celebration or simply a meaningful evening together.\nRead more\nWritten February 6, 2026",
